874affd4a90d952e7a59e9d671689ff2cf746","06edc2494fd8d3c790ea6344976a6e04cd7987a3"],"m":117},{"id":"3drive_p5_118","t":"First 3D homework from me\n\nPrice kept coming down because there are no fresh demand zones except the one it bounced off which is an sbr/snr flip area.","a":"faridisham","d":"","n":"#118","p":5,"im":["94c4c65a34306144090048da7c1f2dae4f00eb88"],"m":118},{"id":"3drive_p5_119","t":"faridisham wrote: First 3D homework from me\n\nnice, keep them coming...","a":"Les_Paul","d":"","n":"#119","p":5,"im":["94c4c65a34306144090048da7c1f2dae4f00eb88"],"m":119},{"id":"3drive_p5_120","t":"Hi, My first homework on 3 Drive attached. Are they correct Comments are appreciated. Thanks Dave","a":"236dave","d":"","n":"#120","p":5,"im":["e225a2f95858ff165e44fd02746b1c20194578cb","e8c185b2b8d5e962b323f5e86c6900f154d071c3","97c0bc8360e32d0d112ca45d741452f9e5316671"],"m":120},{"id":"3drive_p5_121","t":"236dave wrote: Hi, My first homework on 3 Drive attached. Are they correct Comments are appreciated. Thanks Dave\n\nall good here","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#121","p":5,"im":[],"m":121},{"id":"3drive_p5_122","t":"I found many 3DRIVE pattern on charts, but many of them have not all S/D pockets consumed or they are not located near big supply or demand zones.\n\nSo I have a question: to be a nice tradable 3DRIVE it should have all Supply or Demand pockets consumed and must be located near bigger supply or domand area so the price when touch big SD zone can run through the 3DRIVE without any resistance?\n\n3DRIVE on 5M chart\n\nZoom to 1M chart of possible 3Drive on the right of previous 5M chart\n\nThis one has all supply zones consumed but doesnt end to strong demand area, but after a while price is free to shoot up through the 3Drive","a":"Andyfx","d":"","n":"#122","p":5,"im":["0018225ae9b78a7dc5337209e470ea6b0b1734be","40442ef1c29f7d31b6e1a97a852e73b6d81dbee0","7cfe9b4840c1e98c1dfc10c54fafb4bee891331c"],"m":122},{"id":"3drive_p5_123","t":"Hi, I have posted some more 3 Drive examples, but I am struggling to find many, perhaps its just me. Anyway I have found what might be another few, although there are no bear flags. Comments are appreciated. Dave","a":"236dave","d":"","n":"#123","p":5,"im":["0f29bde1f71cd45d08f2321cd8486b2456461aad","04978dcd57e40b8b6abe794e69826d2be179f5b8"],"m":123},{"id":"3drive_p5_124","t":"I believe I got this right?:D\n\nAUD/USD M15","a":"maximohmax","d":"","n":"#124","p":5,"im":["48f776a10740f7f7a4fe40c82655b40ce089f75a"],"m":124},{"id":"3drive_p5_125","t":"Here is a 3 drive which looks quite promising ( to me )\n\nUSDCAD daily.\n\nIn the first movement to 3 drive, price had a good move up breaking through supply zones until it reacted with a much stronger supply zone 1. Then it retraced to test the swap zone went up creating a fresh demand zone 2 and broke through the supply zone and reacted with stacked supply zone 3 and came back and tested its fresh demand zone 2 then it rallied towards supply zone 4 which is also a pivot high.","a":"maximohmax","d":"","n":"#125","p":5,"im":["a2efdc9ed9e0c9f71d1ad37b021741d709368667"],"m":125}],"images":[{"k":"b171483600f653c9c5340488cb001ab779261fbf","t":"assets/thumbs/b171483600f653c9c5340488cb001ab779261fbf.webp","f":"assets/images/b171483600f653c9c5340488cb001ab779261fbf.jpeg","w":1281,"h":543,"b":67328,"o":"b171483600f653c9c5340488cb001ab779261fbf.jpeg","p":5,"pid":"3drive_p5_103"},{"k":"30b37474e61c6259eed22fcbc731efc5a8f70813","t":"assets/thumbs/30b37474e61c6259eed22fcbc731efc5a8f70813.webp","f":"assets/images/30b37474e61c6259eed22fcbc731efc5a8f70813.png","w":1272,"h":656,"b":31537,"o":"30b37474e61c6259eed22fcbc731efc5a8f70813.png","p":5,"pid":"3drive_p5_104"},{"k":"d601b192b69bde3effad2a688bcf3274c009827a","t":"assets/thumbs/d601b192b69bde3effad2a688bcf3274c009827a.webp","f":"assets/images/d601b192b69bde3effad2a688bcf3274c009827a.jpeg","w":1365,"h":708,"b":84295,"o":"d601b192b69bde3effad2a688bcf3274c009827a.jpeg","p":5,"pid":"3drive_p5_105"},{"k":"1fbb25ee338ff6dfd2e7